    <article class="card doc-content prose">
      <div class="kicker">Concepts</div>
      <h1>Packages & modes</h1>
      <p class="lead">A package is what you deploy; a mode is how BASRUN runs it.</p>

      <h2>Package formats</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Single file</strong>: great for small jobs (`main.basil`).</li>
        <li><strong>ZIP</strong>: include multiple modules and assets.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Modes</h2>
      <div class="grid grid-3" style="margin-top: 10px;">
        <div class="card card-pad">
          <div class="badge">Scheduled</div>
          <p style="margin-top: 10px;">Runs on a cron expression and records run history.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card card-pad">
          <div class="badge">Webhook</div>
          <p style="margin-top: 10px;">Runs when an HTTP request hits your unique URL.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card card-pad">
          <div class="badge">REST</div>
          <p style="margin-top: 10px;">Routes multiple endpoints under a base API path.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</main>

